{"path":"docs/concepts/overview/working-with-objects/field-selectors/index.html","title":"Field Selectors","description":"Field selectors let you select Kubernetes objects based on the value of one or more resource fields. Here are some examples of field selector queries:","body":{"type":"document","children":[{"type":"heading","level":1,"id":null,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Field Selectors"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Field selectors"}]},{"type":"text","value":" let you select Kubernetes "},{"type":"link","href":"docs/concepts/overview/working-with-objects/index.html#kubernetes-objects","title":"An entity in the Kubernetes system, representing part of the state of your cluster.","children":[{"type":"text","value":"objects"}]},{"type":"text","value":" based on the value of one or more resource fields. Here are some examples of field selector queries:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"start":null,"items":[{"children":[{"type":"inline_code","code":"metadata.name=my-service"}]},{"children":[{"type":"inline_code","code":"metadata.namespace!=default"}]},{"children":[{"type":"inline_code","code":"status.phase=Pending"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This "},{"type":"inline_code","code":"kubectl"},{"type":"text","value":" command selects all Pods for which the value of the "},{"type":"link","href":"https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle/#pod-phase","title":null,"children":[{"type":"inline_code","code":"status.phase"}]},{"type":"text","value":" field is "},{"type":"inline_code","code":"Running"},{"type":"text","value":":"}]},{"type":"code_block","language":"bash","code":"kubectl get pods --field-selector status.phase=Running"},{"type":"heading","level":4,"id":null,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Note:"}]},{"type":"text","value":"Field selectors are essentially resource "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"filters"}]},{"type"